Z||000002||stimpy||10-28-2000||10:35 AM||||I've been missed, damn, I'm touched...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Bam is right, the past couple of weeks I have been rare from the forum due to getting ready for my wedding on Oct 14. Then it was honeymoon in Cozumel!  If anyone is looking for a great vacation destination, I HIGHLY recommend Cozumel. 4 nights, all inclusive at the very swank El Cozumeleno Beach Resort including airfare from Dallas only set us back $1100! You can't party like that at home for that money...<P>I am working on getting to that 1000th post,  but you know me, I do like those contraversial (or just plain weird) subjects. So help a brother out...go out on a limb, people! <P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
